art_61c060d0-153b-495d-96f8-4fb3c65f7f1b_plan_v1	61c060d0-153b-495d-96f8-4fb3c65f7f1b	plan	Implement a scoring system for the Snake game where eating food increases the score by 10 times the snake's length after growth. The score will be initialized to 0, reset on new games, and displayed in the UI above the game board.	\N	2026-07-14 13:42:54.24447+00	\N
art_114b6d12-10dc-482d-a3c5-a11f3c969f62_plan_v1	114b6d12-10dc-482d-a3c5-a11f3c969f62	plan	Add a second food type — a rotten apple — to the snake game. It spawns alongside the normal food in a different color/cell, and eating it shrinks the snake by one segment and subtracts 20 points (score floored at 0), then respawns on a free cell. If a length-1 snake eats a rotten apple, the game ends instead of shrinking below 1 segment. Normal food behavior (grow by 1, +10*newLength score) is unchanged.	\N	2026-07-13 22:56:33.434427+00	\N
