aeb886b66e1b3d59ae5cf87bc50b50cb60505944	baseline	\N	https://github.com/Kris0102/AgenticDevOps_DemoProject_2	\N	README.md	\N	file	# demo-snake\n\nA small browser implementation of the classic snake game.\n\n- `src/game.js` — the game rules as pure functions (no DOM access)\n- `src/ui.js` — canvas rendering, keyboard input and the game clock\n- `test/game.test.js` — unit tests for the game rules (`node:test`, zero dependencies)\n\n## Play\n\nServe the directory and open it in a browser:\n\n```bash\npython3 -m http.server 8080\n# open http://localhost:8080\n```\n\nSteer with the arrow keys. Eat the food to grow; hitting a wall or your own\nbody ends the game.\n\n## Test\n\n```bash\nnpm test\n```\n\n## Roadmap\n\n- Scoring (not implemented yet — eating food awards no points and no score is shown)\n	[-0.023110751,0.03437959,-0.03308591,0.011057271,-0.008027061,-0.07681878,-0.01202269,-0.0037094494,-0.06116271,-0.0046951943,-0.03424932,-0.01825787,0.057023704,0.025957977,0.07126798,-0.053339843,0.050964743,0.023486907,0.062045805,-0.094078854,-0.027805341,0.013852097,0.06710018,-0.03370338,-0.05798867,-0.019844966,-0.042100072,0.0011205754,-0.048202574,-0.09397934,0.021786828,-0.055974416,-0.010605188,-0.08415411,-0.005934909,0.058563758,-0.014627696,-0.11697238,-0.0797652,0.02781854,0.06232919,0.033902075,-0.014224975,-0.0058339285,0.011456041,-0.021762893,-0.15433623,-0.026606083,-0.0089564,-0.035341725,-0.08609869,-0.008941033,-0.024792993,-0.057628017,0.012588339,0.003965177,-0.019894764,0.0032352144,0.028992759,-0.0018869033,0.027968062,-0.0071563465,0.04192601,0.047797818,0.07116046,-0.06875154,-0.012082252,-0.0043708803,-0.013672371,0.037076186,-0.046403084,-0.0139083825,0.027371509,-0.014187474,0.017133294,-0.044801526,-0.04991632,-0.026790781,-0.054803044,0.024208874,-0.10692449,-0.10480887,0.014625176,0.06886038,0.041355774,0.114378534,0.010324847,0.057000984,0.05094174,0.00851784,-0.03379332,-0.05230976,0.020786233,0.08821635,-0.020710884,0.018506821,0.0619079