lesson_647b0a25-92f2-46d0-b0cc-a89ef02dfcd8_plan_0	https://github.com/Kris0102/AgenticDevOps_DemoProject_2	647b0a25-92f2-46d0-b0cc-a89ef02dfcd8	reviewer	plan	reviewer	- MT1 description/test_strategy: existing test/game.test.js has a shared state(overrides) helper used by ~10 of the 14 existing tests that does not set score/highScore fields; once step() computes newScore = state.score + points, calling step() on these fixtures yields score: NaN, violating the plan's own GameState contract (score: number) and breaking 'Tests pass'. Fix: add an explicit microtask step (or extend MT1's scope) to update the shared test helper in test/game.test.js to default score: 0, highScore: 0, and update MT1's test_strategy to state this fixture change explicitly rather than just 're-run existing 14 tests to confirm no regressions'.	\N	[-0.09022268,-0.019850662,0.056803163,0.07411967,0.03324052,-0.038272813,-0.09978276,-0.0059802053,-0.03287435,0.025601888,-0.04539319,0.003924967,-0.004488524,0.038818397,0.006957588,-0.029839173,-0.010308581,-0.08374464,0.042975973,0.008854696,-0.0070949337,-0.06196715,0.020829348,0.036900934,0.09029049,0.006785673,-0.0763251,0.03628772,-0.038002446,-0.009718915,0.076027796,-0.006800944,-0.003026559,0.01826431,0.013257428,0.052540924,0.00727273,-0.049706623,-0.09179865,0.030779738,0.07807709,0.009084076,0.062301442,-0.03723878,0.05429738,-0.050609294,0.0011329069,-0.062289227,-0.042651493,0.023796614,-0.021396695,0.04239741,0.008552426,-0.028754106,0.04228063,0.072236344,-0.0057645743,0.068597056,0.014467588,0.0051754615,-0.056172546,-0.067256,0.055791732,-0.03454045,0.060575727,0.02242946,0.008106386,-0.031008353,-0.024136774,0.040437955,0.010162121,0.06269513,0.066489674,-0.037516743,0.026840007,0.08153624,-0.10006346,-0.068871096,0.04998218,-0.025913835,-0.100403495,-0.13603653,-0.040878143,-0.024275783,0.034462776,0.04626799,0.04817159,-0.04555791,0.049968034,-0.014150356,0.0013092466,-0.05197989,-0.021352908,0.11447612,-0.033172563,0.019448236,-