lesson_c57057ed-ffae-48e7-8b49-d4f4635f276c_code_update_test_fixtures	https://github.com/Kris0102/AgenticDevOps_DemoProject_2	c57057ed-ffae-48e7-8b49-d4f4635f276c	tester	code	import_error	The `state` helper function in `test/game.test.js` is not exported, preventing the synthesized verification test from importing it to assert that the default score is 0. Additionally, importing the test file triggers the execution of its internal test suite, causing timeouts/cancellations in the test runner.	Export the `state` helper function in `test/game.test.js` by changing `function state(overrides)` to `export function state(overrides)`. This allows the verification test to access the function without relying on side-effects of importing the entire test file.	[-0.049615726,-0.0071045756,-0.044796653,0.04242609,0.091072954,-0.023262078,-0.08784233,0.008586185,-0.030123943,0.026063543,-0.023191158,-0.013927513,-0.018720813,0.046468798,-0.028448569,-0.047471236,-0.033676904,-0.091476254,0.026206432,0.0046095406,-0.044060126,-0.06989314,0.0808844,-0.00040101362,0.0025897787,-0.0213758,-0.028918745,-0.016473718,-0.052232098,-0.01797716,0.0008187644,-0.027594611,-0.046292696,0.0057481206,0.038060818,0.055143587,0.013201491,-0.031620204,-0.04084097,-0.004768424,0.056998484,0.011571244,-0.016019013,-0.027028257,0.036460984,0.0010394847,-0.037149925,-0.04429253,-0.04674437,0.046912916,-0.031992532,0.045618437,0.0004022792,-0.111232825,0.007338257,0.109729946,0.084238715,0.06911038,-0.015323441,0.095908165,0.0109611945,-0.05327002,0.004325281,-0.02903146,0.06473615,0.030306976,-0.031711172,0.013582254,-0.07746581,-0.025017342,-0.016054045,0.045443483,0.052946292,0.0053785103,0.004748343,0.020730747,-0.085762806,-0.026120408,0.08894555,-0.025901137,-0.060860805,-0.13452478,-0.058168318,0.026604153,0.05214622,0.12012023,0.118775904,-0.0019800172,0.022476526,0.023723513,-0.020414403,-0.045861464,-0.030300224,0.077213354,-0.015508272,0.06301983,0.028012393,0.043209065,0.007973357,-0.0454230