 empty strings as 0', ...)`: Assert `levenshteinDistance('', '')` returns `0`.\n2. `test('calculates distance between strings with spaces', ...)`: Assert `levenshteinDistance('hello world', 'hello')` returns `6`.\n3. `test('calculates distance for case-sensitive strings', ...)`: Assert `levenshteinDistance('Berlin', 'berlin')` returns `1` (case-sensitive).\n4. `test('demonstrates symmetry of distance calculation', ...)`: Assert `levenshteinDistance('kitten', 'sitting')` equals `levenshteinDistance('sitting', 'kitten')`.\n5. `test('calculates distance for transposed characters', ...)`: Assert `levenshteinDistance('ab', 'ba')` returns `2`.\n6. `test('calculates distance for substring matches', ...)`: Assert `levenshteinDistance('cat', 'catalog')` returns `3`.	["/workspace/repo/utils.js", "/workspace/repo/tests/weather.test.js"]
